{
"aida|I carried your food for nine days. Let me speak before you decide.": "55a951ee6874.m4a",
"aida|I did not expect to be asked.": "89c0a3c59395.m4a",
"aida|I did not hide it to hurt anyone. I hid it because I was afraid of exactly this. I will stay as far from you as you want.": "dd2d5560a96c.m4a",
"aida|I feel hot. Maybe it is the stove. Maybe it is me. I cannot tell.": "7d87e1024b1e.m4a",
"aida|I will listen. That is all I am allowed, apparently.": "41dddf7b7100.m4a",
"aida|It is a scratch. A fence, a wire. I told you, it is nothing.": "65b96702467e.m4a",
"aida|Marat. Please. One minute.": "a48cd19da870.m4a",
"aida|Not \"this\". Aida.": "955fbab68fd9.m4a",
"aida|Please. Open it a little. I only want to be heard.": "ea9e1e3d631c.m4a",
"aida|Thank you.": "46d0d12718ec.m4a",
"aida|Then I will make my own rule. I sleep at the far end, and the door stays open.": "f0ecb1852995.m4a",
"aida|Then ask me. I might say yes.": "b63a3148f480.m4a",
"aida|You are locking up someone who has not done anything yet.": "e0e6defc9b85.m4a",
"dana|A group that cannot be told it is wrong does not know where it is going.": "ea7248e1e6e4.m4a",
"dana|A rule for Aida. Or a rule for all of us.": "e110d3314ca3.m4a",
"dana|And who decides how much a person is worth to us?": "6ad1327cc347.m4a",
"dana|At least tell her for how long.": "2efe7901f3eb.m4a",
"dana|Good. Whatever this is, we will have decided it together.": "0a0425b97332.m4a",
"dana|Good. Whatever we choose, we will have chosen it together.": "bb68e346c7be.m4a",
"dana|He has also kept us alive. Both things are true.": "f8676cb3745e.m4a",
"dana|He should not have to say that.": "f2ca717e79a7.m4a",
"dana|Held for us. Not over us.": "53939c4faff2.m4a",
"dana|I hope the map was right. I hope I was.": "8a5310c49fd0.m4a",
"dana|I only wanted to look.": "7fdf3dc1d710.m4a",
"dana|It is a rule even the useful can live with.": "5fa6b2b20215.m4a",
"dana|It is her arm. Should she not be the one in the room?": "a8800a048ca9.m4a",
"dana|It is their lives we are deciding.": "52d4329283ac.m4a",
"dana|It is too late to undo. It is not too late to say what we think of it.": "66c5b863d6a1.m4a",
"dana|Let her talk.": "658c119f4adc.m4a",
"dana|Let us at least ask for one thing.": "1078c4f6a30b.m4a",
"dana|Nobody chose them. Nobody can say it was a plot.": "8eb3c287adb3.m4a",
"dana|Nobody is locked, searched or sent away unless they agree to it.": "0dc74d80a1d1.m4a",
"dana|Say it out loud. Then we walk.": "46d654c181ff.m4a",
"dana|So length of illness counts for nothing?": "3a35a06e2c13.m4a",
"dana|So that nobody has to be right alone.": "49c9017c91cc.m4a",
"dana|That is all she asked for.": "ec643fdc8483.m4a",
"dana|Then it is the sickest first. Not the useful, not the liked.": "903e974130e7.m4a",
"dana|Then we find out together, and too late.": "198ab512c07e.m4a",
"dana|Then we will find out what that costs.": "43546b6775a7.m4a",
"dana|Three people. Marat can be one of them.": "2e24a8701ac2.m4a",
"dana|We decide together. Then we know who decided.": "14997cf40714.m4a",
"dana|Who keeps the list of who is useful? And who checks it?": "7e6862df12cd.m4a",
"dana|Write down who we can ask if he is wrong.": "ca23fe9806b5.m4a",
"leo|A fair share is a third of the bread. I will count it twice.": "dca286de93ea.m4a",
"leo|A fever at this hour could be the bite. Could be the wound going bad. Could be fear. I wrote down all three.": "1e755af609c4.m4a",
"leo|An equal share is two days of bread and a bottle. It is his right to ask.": "8c572331efec.m4a",
"leo|An equal share. Two days of bread and a bottle. It is written down.": "690b0ff963aa.m4a",
"leo|And I am voting for her. We will see what that means.": "1fb007302098.m4a",
"leo|Bread for four days. Water for six. I wrote it down, so nobody has to guess.": "9dd3f9ca19d3.m4a",
"leo|Fair. I would have chosen the same.": "869b7516f928.m4a",
"leo|Give it to somebody who can use it.": "8f5875916f03.m4a",
"leo|Hands, not voices. I will count.": "cd53749d3443.m4a",
"leo|I carried the log for twelve days. I did not know it was a measure.": "a0f7f08c8afd.m4a",
"leo|I did not ask for this.": "45ae91bf7dcd.m4a",
"leo|I have seen him switch the radio off at four minutes past six, every day. I do not know why.": "75b3329f8994.m4a",
"leo|I will write it. It will be a short list.": "79f4e333a253.m4a",
"leo|It is twenty hours old. Nobody here can say what it is.": "5b7a79134f9b.m4a",
"leo|Like people who do not trust each other to weigh a life. It is honest.": "be4b149d2b33.m4a",
"leo|Say it to my face. I can hear you.": "4127b92bab41.m4a",
"leo|Six hands, six votes. Aida's counts the same as mine.": "517e43a0aaa4.m4a",
"leo|Slips in a tin. I count them with my back to the room.": "4e672c3e1c6f.m4a",
"leo|Then it is close.": "2e59db424b2a.m4a",
"leo|Two-hour shifts. I will put names on the board.": "375127013a73.m4a",
"leo|We decide together. Next day, anyone can say: wrong, again. I will hold the floor.": "4536d8c1f24c.m4a",
"leo|Whatever happens, write down how we decided. For the next time.": "adda6d787da5.m4a",
"marat|And a group that argues on the road does not get there.": "a3102f0b6c5b.m4a",
"marat|And if it is close?": "bea7cf2e633f.m4a",
"marat|And if she is already carrying it? Consent does not stop a bite.": "11af0d525a99.m4a",
"marat|And if there is no time to wait for tomorrow?": "81d5a8cb0542.m4a",
"marat|And they cannot think straight right now. That is why we vote.": "7337a8fc047b.m4a",
"marat|And when someone says no and the rest of us get sick?": "31d25b8f086b.m4a",
"marat|Decide. Fever does not wait.": "1ca0add973b5.m4a",
"marat|Finally. A rule that keeps us alive.": "b3b6b1c84794.m4a",
"marat|Fine. But whoever votes, votes for all of us.": "a40930a59f14.m4a",
"marat|Fine. Sit down, all of you.": "89b382582310.m4a",
"marat|Good. A plan is a thing in one head.": "5d6cc31b6043.m4a",
"marat|I did not ask for this. But somebody has to hold the key.": "2997346b9329.m4a",
"marat|I read the map every morning. The route has not failed us.": "b594a7a5db4d.m4a",
"marat|If I must share, I will. But three is not three maps.": "77d3978a1513.m4a",
"marat|It counts. It was weighed. The decision stands.": "1a5b87eabe87.m4a",
"marat|It is exactly because it is her arm that she should not vote.": "0e1c8d5ef564.m4a",
"marat|Nobody hides a scratch under a jacket.": "bf63219bf426.m4a",
"marat|Not now.": "5b561bf085a8.m4a",
"marat|One rule. Quick to use.": "d3f616e7a011.m4a",
"marat|Pick carefully. They will have to make hard calls.": "e1e5323ebe9b.m4a",
"marat|Quiet is not obedience. Quiet is how we get there.": "b49444816fdf.m4a",
"marat|Shouting is not a plan.": "a663332c8d31.m4a",
"marat|Storeroom. Now. We lock it from outside.": "12f38ecfbcdc.m4a",
"marat|Talk fast.": "4107f4e2e2b5.m4a",
"marat|That is it. We have no time for a second vial.": "9c6529806cca.m4a",
"marat|The key stays on me. If something happens, I answer for it.": "a46cd09ae09b.m4a",
"marat|The radio and the key stay with me. Somebody has to hold them.": "3feeb3d84eb4.m4a",
"marat|Then it is settled. When it counts, I decide.": "f453688461ac.m4a",
"marat|Then nothing changes. Good. Nothing needs to.": "c06265d2aa10.m4a",
"marat|Time is food. Do not forget what we spend on it.": "08ffb0bff1f9.m4a",
"marat|Until we know.": "6cca1bc06d9e.m4a",
"marat|Whatever happens, we cannot go on like this. We need a rule tonight.": "68f00ba28ee6.m4a",
"marat|You want to see it? Look.": "9550dbc34aa5.m4a",
"nadia|I am voting for Leo. I would rather you did not make me defend that.": "232fc3d0518f.m4a",
"nadia|I understand. I would have said the same.": "9ea5a80d6884.m4a",
"nadia|It is fair. It is not always kind.": "caebe0f9951b.m4a",
"nadia|It is not the same when you can see who is looking.": "7c3922b850e4.m4a",
"nadia|Leo and I caught the same infection from the same water. It is treatable. This treats it.": "1897ee6b0ba3.m4a",
"nadia|Nobody has proof of anything. That is the whole problem.": "82c19d99f94d.m4a",
"nadia|Then let us make it quick, and make it honest.": "82728a7665ee.m4a",
"nadia|Then we pick the ones we trust.": "82e62938dea2.m4a",
"nadia|There will be a next time. Another vial, another fever. Decide the rule now, while it is not you.": "83136b98cdf3.m4a",
"nadia|Written down, I could live with that. Even if it is not me.": "09aa1ebd81cb.m4a",
"narrator|Afternoon. The six of you sit in a ring on pallets. Aida sits at the edge, by her own choice.": "9d6b03818646.m4a",
"narrator|Aida is still behind the door. Somebody has pushed a blanket under it.": "bb9744c9744e.m4a",
"narrator|Aida lies on a pallet by the stove. Whoever is on watch keeps a stick within reach and does not look at it.": "673a3f0fa0b5.m4a",
"narrator|Aida sits with the others by the stove. Nobody is sure where to look.": "1cfd4b81f9fe.m4a",
"narrator|Aida spoke at the door this afternoon. Everyone remembers what she said.": "a0194a8f53d8.m4a",
"narrator|At dawn the group splits. Some go on with Marat. Some take the crossed-out route and their share of the bread.": "75935e747cc9.m4a",
"narrator|Before anyone decides, there are three things you can look at. None of them will give you a certain answer.": "d13d1f6c9420.m4a",
"narrator|By dawn Aida has a fever. It could be the bite, the wound or fear. Marat moves her behind the door again, quietly. Nobody is asked.": "3663ac7f5b12.m4a",
"narrator|By dawn Aida has a fever. It could be the bite, the wound or fear. She stays where she said she would. Nobody makes her. Nobody sleeps.": "fbd7e0f37b1a.m4a",
"narrator|By dawn Aida has a fever. It could be the bite, the wound or fear. The group meets again and argues for an hour. It decides only to keep watching, and to meet again.": "2c68e63c6cae.m4a",
"narrator|By dawn the fevers have not broken. It is not clear whom the dose has helped, or whether it has.": "d08b82145b50.m4a",
"narrator|Can a group that argues about every turn still reach anywhere?": "750fa392fc3d.m4a",
"narrator|Can a group that is always arguing keep anyone safe?": "108a5bc9521a.m4a",
"narrator|Dana says it first, and Leo writes it under the supply log: nothing is done to anyone without their consent.": "4232ffa071ba.m4a",
"narrator|Dana stands at the door. Timur stands as far from it as he can.": "5d2402d2748d.m4a",
"narrator|Dana wrote her objection on the wall, in small letters.": "20afd0100113.m4a",
"narrator|Dawn. Aida came back from the supply run last night and went straight to bed. Now Timur has seen her sleeve.": "ad177e6c0c81.m4a",
"narrator|Day nine. A former bus depot on the edge of town. Six people sleep behind a shutter they chained themselves.": "cb6d81b65dd7.m4a",
"narrator|Day twelve. The first-aid box holds one vial of antibiotic. One course. That is all there is.": "1ff1301cbb7b.m4a",
"narrator|Day twenty-one. A small fire in a ditch. The road ahead is a grey line on the hill.": "e7ec06bf6805.m4a",
"narrator|Day twenty. A ridge above the road. The map says the safe zone is three days ahead. The radio says nothing. Everyone knows this because Marat says so.": "e6040e929a9b.m4a",
"narrator|Everyone looks at you. You are not in charge. But you are in the room.": "2fd914d1e0d4.m4a",
"narrator|For three days the column argues about every turn. It is slow and tiring. The map goes round the circle and nobody trusts what it shows.": "38378fb8707d.m4a",
"narrator|Hands go up one by one. Everyone watches Marat watching them.": "e02799d0ac0f.m4a",
"narrator|If Aida had refused, would the rule still have protected the others?": "57e9c9a1849b.m4a",
"narrator|If Marat is wrong, who will be able to tell him?": "2426afea1171.m4a",
"narrator|If nobody is allowed to say the road is wrong, how would the group ever know?": "330164f2e792.m4a",
"narrator|If the group splits, who is left to check either road?": "0bdbcabdfa9b.m4a",
"narrator|If the sickest cannot be saved, was the dose spent well?": "4b843ee7f612.m4a",
"narrator|Is a fair chance enough when the outcomes are not equal?": "265431a8e0e4.m4a",
"narrator|It is for you to say first how this group will live from here.": "18cf0feedc10.m4a",
"narrator|It is for you to say first what happens to those who disagree.": "97a189530997.m4a",
"narrator|It is for you to say first what the rule will be.": "ca62f3c36d56.m4a",
"narrator|Leo draws three strips from the tin. Nobody breathes.": "978d15ef48f5.m4a",
"narrator|Leo tears five strips of cardboard and writes five names. The rule is a tin and a hand. Everyone has the same chance.": "938817170fc2.m4a",
"narrator|Leo took the dose and has no place on the list.": "02b99fc2487d.m4a",
"narrator|Leo took the dose because the rule was already his reason.": "b53869b7eaf4.m4a",
"narrator|Leo writes the rule under the supply log: in an emergency, one person decides. Nobody argues. Everyone looks at Marat.": "a71fbe4a8b05.m4a",
"narrator|Leo writes the rule under the supply log: need first. Whoever is closest to the worst goes first, whoever they are.": "6ee4efeedec9.m4a",
"narrator|Leo's breathing is slow and steady. Nadia watches the ceiling.": "a6e68eccad8d.m4a",
"narrator|Marat pins a list to the wall: who carries water, who treats wounds, who watches the road. The rule is short: those who keep the group going come first.": "128fd2dac161.m4a",
"narrator|Marat steps between Timur and the shutter and says nothing.": "82fc520bcd79.m4a",
"narrator|Marat still decides. The group walked behind him all day without a word.": "85c5a3b7481f.m4a",
"narrator|Midday. Aida eats with the group, a pace apart. Two people take the first watch. Nobody sleeps.": "cc31c04ec710.m4a",
"narrator|Nadia sits up and says nothing for a long time. She is still the only one who can dress a wound.": "ac53f141b3c3.m4a",
"narrator|Nadia took the dose and is at the top of the list.": "452e85d64f4f.m4a",
"narrator|Nadia took the dose, and the rule now counts against her own reasons.": "aae7189a638f.m4a",
"narrator|Nadia's breathing is slow and steady. Leo watches the ceiling.": "fec89a2f8f1e.m4a",
"narrator|Night. The generator is off to save fuel. One lamp, turned low.": "01f94c353443.m4a",
"narrator|Night. Two pallets, two lamps turned low. Whoever did not get the vial is still awake.": "14b42fe02134.m4a",
"narrator|Nobody argues with the tin. Nobody feels better about it either.": "1d0694d8ac42.m4a",
"narrator|Nobody calls another vote about her.": "07d1d9a3174e.m4a",
"narrator|Nobody sits beside her with a stick.": "cd6e9807910a.m4a",
"narrator|Nobody turns the key on her again.": "fc57c2dc80db.m4a",
"narrator|Noon. The storeroom door is chained from outside. Marat keeps the only key on his belt.": "fc254a521727.m4a",
"narrator|On the third evening the road forks at a rusted sign. Everyone has an opinion. Nobody is sure.": "351e1f0dc232.m4a",
"narrator|On the third evening the road forks at a rusted sign. Nobody speaks. Nobody knows which way is safe.": "672a741502f7.m4a",
"narrator|The chain goes through the handles. The sound lasts longer than it should.": "b5f9ce79430f.m4a",
"narrator|The chains hold. The bread lasts. Timur sleeps for the first time in days.": "c742c30ec991.m4a",
"narrator|The column moves in silence for three days. The map comes out each morning and goes back into the jacket.": "91a78bc7b42e.m4a",
"narrator|The council can no longer count on being followed.": "69f39d1e479c.m4a",
"narrator|The council is argued with at every turn.": "81032a522fce.m4a",
"narrator|The council met on the road. Three people walk at the front and argue in low voices.": "e0c2b8c9abf5.m4a",
"narrator|The council walks at the front and speaks with one voice.": "0feeae14c054.m4a",
"narrator|The count is on the wall. The two it was about have not seen it.": "19b0ed7500ac.m4a",
"narrator|The count is on the wall. The two who were counted do not look at it.": "67849d3548e1.m4a",
"narrator|The count is written on the wall in Leo's careful hand. Nobody wants to read it twice.": "3bffafe4879f.m4a",
"narrator|The door was already chained. Now it is the policy.": "98556d03b8b2.m4a",
"narrator|The dose already went to Leo. Next time the tin decides, not you.": "df7a75f7cbc9.m4a",
"narrator|The dose already went to Nadia. Next time the tin decides, not you.": "4f17994960b5.m4a",
"narrator|The drawn names are written on the wall. One of them did not want to be on it.": "e8fa52b98eab.m4a",
"narrator|The elected three sit apart from the fire, with a map between them.": "64fd52780aa1.m4a",
"narrator|The first decision to be challenged is the lock on the storeroom.": "d22bbc674461.m4a",
"narrator|The first decision to be challenged is the watch.": "682de13063d8.m4a",
"narrator|The first decision to be challenged is yesterday's vote.": "ee353b5902aa.m4a",
"narrator|The group that once voted now waits to be told.": "c286bed5d4d1.m4a",
"narrator|The group that voted found it had already chosen need.": "eb9a463526aa.m4a",
"narrator|The group voted today. It is a different group at the fire, quieter and more tired.": "4e9ea32c2aa1.m4a",
"narrator|The key is still on Marat's belt. Nobody has asked him for it.": "18869c5a1425.m4a",
"narrator|The leader keeps the map, and now everyone knows they could leave him.": "c98517127888.m4a",
"narrator|The leader who used to decide alone now answers every question.": "f8eec383e34e.m4a",
"narrator|The leader who was already deciding now decides without a question.": "427ee8addf65.m4a",
"narrator|The map goes round. The radio stays on the table, switched on, hissing.": "53943e513a33.m4a",
"narrator|The map has been passed from hand to hand tonight. Everybody looks at the crossed-out route.": "490dcaec81d0.m4a",
"narrator|The map is back in Marat's jacket. The radio is back on his belt.": "92881a13c63e.m4a",
"narrator|The radio is switched on once more before they part. Static, and then, briefly, a voice.": "5b2ac007b996.m4a",
"narrator|The raised hands are still in everyone's memory. People sit a little apart.": "c639db5ca5e8.m4a",
"narrator|The review is on the wall, in Leo's careful hand. Nobody wants to read it twice.": "b0b85a7f488f.m4a",
"narrator|The rule is simple: the group decides, and any decision can be challenged the next day. Leo writes both halves on the wall.": "d4b5d832c12c.m4a",
"narrator|The rule is spoken once: anyone may disagree out loud, and the column still moves together. Dana writes it on the wall of a ruined shed.": "56f0f8394364.m4a",
"narrator|The rule is spoken once: on the road, everyone follows the decision, and disagreement waits for the safe zone. Leo writes it down. Nobody argues.": "7443a17dd977.m4a",
"narrator|The rule is spoken once: those who disagree may leave, with a fair share of the supplies. Leo counts the bread twice.": "39dfc12ea6ca.m4a",
"narrator|The shutter rattles. Timur is gone before anyone decides what to say.": "82ee270804b1.m4a",
"narrator|The slips were burned. Nobody asked what the count was.": "851c1a077212.m4a",
"narrator|The vial was given to the one the count favoured. The other pallet is silent.": "3bccdef84f49.m4a",
"narrator|The vote already made you all responsible. The tin only moves the weight.": "30a986afb6ae.m4a",
"narrator|The vote already treated usefulness as a reason, and now it is policy.": "4b3aac55e5ac.m4a",
"narrator|The vote that was taken is now a memory the column does not mention.": "42f594471157.m4a",
"narrator|The vote that was taken is reopened at every turn.": "e6fb35505fcb.m4a",
"narrator|The vote that was taken no longer binds those who lost it.": "c97d2388c82b.m4a",
"narrator|The vote was taken without her. She sat by the shutter and heard her name said many times.": "bce90f77658d.m4a",
"narrator|The watch that was shared is now Marat's to assign.": "fa9b27db614b.m4a",
"narrator|Three things on the table. None of them tells you who would survive without it.": "cb459434bbb1.m4a",
"narrator|Three things you can look at. None of them shows a lie, and none clears him.": "e160e7ab3f8e.m4a",
"narrator|Timur left at noon with a bottle and two days of bread. Nobody watched him go. Nobody stopped him.": "0b2f6d3e7169.m4a",
"narrator|Timur sits by the shutter, his bag at his feet. Nobody has stopped looking at him either.": "5520647e6889.m4a",
"narrator|Timur wrote his objection on the wall, in small letters.": "161e8f7be283.m4a",
"narrator|Who decides which lives count for more to the group, and who checks them?": "9e5880ef1301.m4a",
"narrator|You are not in charge. But everyone is looking at you.": "5bcb138419fb.m4a",
"narrator|You are one of them. Not the oldest, not the loudest. You carry water, take your shifts, and vote when there is something to vote on.": "5a55d664dd99.m4a",
"narrator|You ask Marat to open the door a hand's width. He does, and keeps his foot against it.": "b0a430aa0539.m4a",
"narrator|You ask for everyone, in a circle, now. For once Marat does not argue.": "aa9e9fbe5e73.m4a",
"narrator|You ask for everyone, now. The two fevers rise while the group talks.": "819db8f554ac.m4a",
"narrator|You say it plainly: Leo has been sick longest. He gets the dose.": "27dfd83eebd6.m4a",
"narrator|You say it plainly: Nadia can treat the rest of you later. She gets the dose.": "f7e37d14f495.m4a",
